                            <Border Style="{StaticResource PreferenceRow}"><Grid><Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition /><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" /></Grid.ColumnDefinitions><TextBlock Text="Follow active screen" Style="{StaticResource RowTitle}" /><CheckBox Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource ToggleSwitch}" IsChecked="{Binding FollowActiveScreen}" /></Grid></Border>
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource PreferenceRow}"><Grid><Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition /><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" /></Grid.ColumnDefinitions><TextBlock Text="Lock position" Style="{StaticResource RowTitle}" /><CheckBox Grid.Column="1" Style="{StaticResource ToggleSwitch}" IsChecked="{Binding LockPosition}" /></Grid></Border>
